Intent:
analyzerkotlinandroid: close the version-catalog table set

catalogFacts tracked whatever name appeared between brackets and emitted
facts only for `[versions]` and `[plugins]`, so an unknown table, a row
outside any table, and a row that was not the closed form for its own
table were all admitted and silently ignored. 92 of the 149 rows in the
