Intent:
contextindex: stop claiming complete impact coverage over uncomputed reverse-imports

DR-0006. reverseImporters searches Index.Imports for one target only --
module + "/" + dir(changedPath), a slash-qualified Go import path -- so for a
changed path in any other language the search is vacuous by construction. The
receipt then reported omitted_results: 0, uncertainty: [] and
critical_missing: [] over that answer, a positive assertion that nothing was
left out made over an answer that left three reverse-import results out on the
measured subject.

