requested changed paths have a reverse-import universe the native Go profile
cannot compute, and names that count in coverage.uncertainty -- the channel
range impact already uses for its non-Go changed paths. omitted_results keeps
its honest value: the engine cannot count what it never computed, and a
fabricated quantity would replace a false completeness claim with a false
number. The note is emitted only when earned, so a Go-only repository's receipt
stays byte-identical.

